1
00:00:05,861 --> 00:00:07,594
(All characters, places, and organizations
in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,594 --> 00:00:09,394
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors, some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:09,728 --> 00:00:11,494
I did love him.

4
00:00:12,094 --> 00:00:13,961
I loved him,

5
00:00:14,028 --> 00:00:17,528
but if I hadn't known, fine.
I knew exactly what family he came from.

6
00:00:18,053 --> 00:00:21,746
Kim Mu Jin, broke and hauling bricks,
how much appeal does he have?

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:27,706
As things stand, I'd be carrying him alone
without a cent of support from you.

8
00:00:27,974 --> 00:00:29,960
Honestly, I'm not up for it.

9
00:00:30,681 --> 00:00:34,718
We only dated a year,
and it's not like we're married.

10
00:00:35,028 --> 00:00:37,524
I'm barely holding on as it is.

11
00:00:38,034 --> 00:00:42,018
How do I know how long
those injuries will drag on?

12
00:00:42,394 --> 00:00:44,960
I can't. I don't want to.

13
00:00:45,175 --> 00:00:47,783
Are you even human?

14
00:00:47,994 --> 00:00:49,327
Are you?

15
00:00:52,033 --> 00:00:54,688
And Mu Jin gave up everything
for a girl like you...

16
00:01:00,594 --> 00:01:01,628
What's this?

17
00:01:01,754 --> 00:01:05,309
He's not the kind of man
to give up on me easily.

18
00:01:06,694 --> 00:01:09,219
It'll take this much to put an end to it.

19
00:01:12,628 --> 00:01:15,661
I'm sorry for the trouble I've caused.

20
00:01:15,987 --> 00:01:17,287
What about...

21
00:01:17,820 --> 00:01:19,191
the hundred thousand?

22
00:01:20,261 --> 00:01:21,495
I don't need it.

23
00:01:41,994 --> 00:01:43,928
(Episode 11)

24
00:01:59,007 --> 00:02:03,236
Did you go to Duhan Girls' Middle School?

25
00:02:06,175 --> 00:02:09,141
- Lim Hye Jeong?
- Han Gyu Rim?

26
00:02:11,606 --> 00:02:15,503
- It's been forever.
- How long has it been?

27
00:02:15,541 --> 00:02:17,516
First time since we graduated, right?

28
00:02:17,541 --> 00:02:20,293
- What are the odds!
- I know.

29
00:02:20,367 --> 00:02:24,167
Forget everyone else, Gyu Rim,
you're the one I really wanted to see.

30
00:02:24,192 --> 00:02:27,247
Same here. I missed you so much.

31
00:02:28,701 --> 00:02:31,383
- Are you due soon too?
- Yes.

32
00:02:33,474 --> 00:02:35,908
I never heard you got married...

33
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:39,736
Is your husband here? What's he like?

34
00:02:42,688 --> 00:02:44,121
I'm not married.

35
00:02:46,227 --> 00:02:47,952
This baby...

36
00:02:50,608 --> 00:02:52,374
is just mine.

37
00:02:56,315 --> 00:02:57,728
A little more.

38
00:03:00,915 --> 00:03:02,148
Just a little more.

39
00:03:05,794 --> 00:03:07,249
Push a little harder.

40
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,940
Almost there.

41
00:03:20,228 --> 00:03:21,728
Where's my baby?

42
00:03:25,694 --> 00:03:30,313
Why can't I hear my baby crying?

43
00:03:31,141 --> 00:03:34,807
During delivery, there was a problem
with the baby's heartbeat.

44
00:03:35,101 --> 00:03:37,489
We did everything we could, but...

45
00:03:38,594 --> 00:03:40,194
I'm sorry.

46
00:03:40,561 --> 00:03:42,037
Are you...

47
00:03:43,728 --> 00:03:45,050
telling me that my baby...

48
00:03:48,407 --> 00:03:53,607
is dead?

49
00:04:25,328 --> 00:04:28,028
(Mom)

50
00:04:33,734 --> 00:04:34,956
Hello?

51
00:04:35,668 --> 00:04:38,583
Is this Ko Yun Hui's phone?

52
00:04:39,314 --> 00:04:41,447
Yes, it is. Who's calling?

53
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:45,072
It's me, Gyu Rim.

54
00:04:47,493 --> 00:04:48,831
Mom.

55
00:04:50,014 --> 00:04:52,574
I heard you remarried.

56
00:04:54,214 --> 00:05:00,048
You seemed to be doing well,
so I wasn't going to call, but...

57
00:05:05,394 --> 00:05:07,694
I just...

58
00:05:09,840 --> 00:05:11,575
missed you so much.

59
00:05:17,588 --> 00:05:18,914
I'm...

60
00:05:22,841 --> 00:05:25,543
having such a hard time right now,

61
00:05:26,900 --> 00:05:29,597
so could you please come be with me?

62
00:05:32,267 --> 00:05:33,624
Just once.

63
00:05:36,128 --> 00:05:37,744
Just this one time.

64
00:05:40,633 --> 00:05:42,710
It's been a long time, Gyu Rim.

65
00:05:44,674 --> 00:05:48,663
I'm sorry I never got in touch.

66
00:05:51,914 --> 00:05:56,153
But right now...

67
00:05:59,868 --> 00:06:04,798
my daughter had appendix surgery today,
so I can't get away for a while.

68
00:06:06,294 --> 00:06:07,494
Mom.

69
00:06:07,794 --> 00:06:09,927
Seo Hyeon. You're up?

70
00:06:11,394 --> 00:06:12,859
I'm sorry.

71
00:06:13,234 --> 00:06:15,923
Things are hectic right now.

72
00:06:16,694 --> 00:06:18,971
I'll call you again later.

73
00:06:19,427 --> 00:06:20,894
I'm sorry.

74
00:06:28,507 --> 00:06:30,182
What do I do?

75
00:06:38,361 --> 00:06:41,078
What am I going to do?

76
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:44,060
It came back to me.

77
00:06:46,794 --> 00:06:49,373
What it was that I lost...

78
00:06:50,247 --> 00:06:53,630
it came back to me. What do I do?

79
00:06:56,287 --> 00:07:00,044
A long time ago, I lost so much.

80
00:07:02,007 --> 00:07:03,445
My mother,

81
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:05,632
my baby,

82
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,523
and Kim Mu Jin.

83
00:07:11,028 --> 00:07:15,127
I lived for years forgetting
that I'd even lost them.

84
00:07:17,254 --> 00:07:20,087
I thought I was doing all right.

85
00:07:21,694 --> 00:07:23,801
Why did it come back to me only now?

86
00:07:41,428 --> 00:07:43,193
I want to help you find it.

87
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,185
But I think I have to go now.

88
00:07:54,973 --> 00:07:59,772
I'm sorry I ran away.

89
00:08:01,927 --> 00:08:07,941
I'm sorry I gave up.

90
00:08:10,593 --> 00:08:12,297
For losing you...

91
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,467
I'm sorry.

92
00:08:23,095 --> 00:08:24,496
The thing you lost.

93
00:08:27,287 --> 00:08:28,604
Is it me?

94
00:08:40,261 --> 00:08:42,038
Can I ever find...

95
00:08:43,614 --> 00:08:45,480
what I lost again?

96
00:08:50,128 --> 00:08:52,320
I'm sorry I lied.

97
00:08:53,407 --> 00:08:57,573
I fooled myself, and I fooled you...

98
00:08:59,780 --> 00:09:01,032
I'm sorry.

99
00:09:01,201 --> 00:09:03,134
I'm so sorry, Mu Jin.

100
00:09:04,381 --> 00:09:07,725
I'm so sorry.

101
00:09:12,494 --> 00:09:14,423
You should have found me sooner.

102
00:09:17,914 --> 00:09:19,984
You should have come back for me sooner.

103
00:09:33,508 --> 00:09:35,346
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

104
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:38,545
I can't come back...

105
00:09:40,028 --> 00:09:41,846
to you.

106
00:09:45,994 --> 00:09:49,594
I'm with someone else now.

107
00:10:00,801 --> 00:10:05,801
Someone will love you as much as I did.

108
00:10:07,707 --> 00:10:12,474
You'll find someone to love again.

109
00:10:14,188 --> 00:10:17,562
When that happens, don't give up.

110
00:10:18,661 --> 00:10:23,194
Don't be afraid. Don't run away.

111
00:10:24,574 --> 00:10:26,430
Don't lose it.

112
00:10:29,961 --> 00:10:34,229
Take care. Stay well.

113
00:11:15,161 --> 00:11:19,784
Gyu Rim! Han Gyu Rim! Hey!

114
00:11:20,773 --> 00:11:23,025
Where is your head at?

115
00:11:24,246 --> 00:11:27,146
Your cast is off. Are you okay now?

116
00:11:27,171 --> 00:11:29,027
Of course I am.

117
00:11:29,127 --> 00:11:32,161
It was never bad enough
to need a cast and all that fuss.

118
00:11:32,728 --> 00:11:36,048
But what about you? Are you okay?

119
00:11:36,581 --> 00:11:40,272
It's only been a week,
so why are you so thin?

120
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:50,129
You and I are done being man and woman.

121
00:11:50,787 --> 00:11:54,021
What? What does that mean?

122
00:11:54,773 --> 00:11:56,086
I'm sorry, Heung Sik.

123
00:11:56,735 --> 00:11:58,901
For going back and forth like this.

124
00:12:03,528 --> 00:12:05,281
I'm awful, aren't I?

125
00:12:07,294 --> 00:12:10,033
Do you want to just hit me?

126
00:12:12,101 --> 00:12:16,081
Hit me as much as you want,
until you're not angry anymore.

127
00:12:31,894 --> 00:12:36,088
I'm fine now. I can breathe fine.

128
00:12:36,681 --> 00:12:38,414
My heart isn't racing either.

129
00:12:42,227 --> 00:12:43,427
You're not going to hit me?

130
00:12:44,474 --> 00:12:46,313
Where would I even hit you?

131
00:12:47,041 --> 00:12:51,374
One flick of my finger
and you'd fly all the way to Jeju Island.

132
00:12:53,466 --> 00:12:54,769
I'm sorry, Heung Sik.

133
00:12:55,428 --> 00:12:57,180
My proposal to you...

134
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:02,928
I'm taking it back.

135
00:13:04,594 --> 00:13:05,861
Is that so?

136
00:13:10,267 --> 00:13:12,500
Well, good call.

137
00:13:12,628 --> 00:13:16,506
Honestly, every time you come close,
I feel like I'm going to die.

138
00:13:16,594 --> 00:13:20,838
This isn't some fight for freedom.
It's not worth dying over.

139
00:13:21,028 --> 00:13:24,194
I was going to dump you first.

140
00:13:26,828 --> 00:13:28,628
Don't forgive me.

141
00:13:29,728 --> 00:13:30,970
All right.

142
00:13:32,094 --> 00:13:36,003
I won't forgive you, so instead,
let's start a savings club.

143
00:13:36,594 --> 00:13:40,094
We each chip in 30 dollars a month
and go out for chicken and beer.

144
00:13:40,374 --> 00:13:42,585
Just as friends, all right?

145
00:13:47,780 --> 00:13:50,332
You haven't told my mom yet, right?

146
00:13:52,074 --> 00:13:54,895
I was going to tell her after this.

147
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,678
No. Absolutely not.

148
00:13:57,928 --> 00:14:00,333
That's because you don't know
what my mom is really like.

149
00:14:01,561 --> 00:14:06,354
Tell her it was all my idea.
Put the whole thing on me.

150
00:14:06,828 --> 00:14:09,394
Got it?

151
00:14:09,854 --> 00:14:12,654
What did you just say?

152
00:14:13,914 --> 00:14:19,547
So you're telling me your proposal
to my Heung Sik...

153
00:14:19,794 --> 00:14:25,188
never happened, and you're wiping
the whole thing off the books?

154
00:14:27,634 --> 00:14:29,362
I'm sorry, Su Nam.

155
00:14:41,694 --> 00:14:45,794
You act without thinking,
and we pay the price.

156
00:14:45,794 --> 00:14:48,828
Then one "I'm sorry" makes it all fine?

157
00:14:48,947 --> 00:14:51,918
Heung Sik and I fell for you so hard...

158
00:14:51,994 --> 00:14:56,896
that we brushed off you being a single mom
with nothing to your name.

159
00:14:56,954 --> 00:15:00,086
Did you take us for a couple of fools?

160
00:15:01,081 --> 00:15:02,955
It's nothing like that, Su Nam.

161
00:15:03,540 --> 00:15:08,340
You think I took a liking to a girl
with your baggage for no reason?

162
00:15:08,394 --> 00:15:11,785
Not a chance in this world.

163
00:15:12,047 --> 00:15:18,161
A fortune teller told me my Heung Sik
is fated to die young.

164
00:15:18,861 --> 00:15:22,994
She said if he married a widow with a kid
or a girl with some flaw,

165
00:15:22,994 --> 00:15:25,094
that curse would lift.

166
00:15:25,253 --> 00:15:27,362
Don't get it twisted.

167
00:15:27,421 --> 00:15:32,450
A single man took you in, kid and all.
Understand?

168
00:15:34,603 --> 00:15:38,503
And now that I think about it, maybe...

169
00:15:38,528 --> 00:15:40,765
Did Gyeol's father come back?

170
00:15:41,528 --> 00:15:43,361
Did he tell you to dump my Heung Sik...

171
00:15:43,361 --> 00:15:47,916
and talk you into playing happy family,
the three of you together?

172
00:15:47,941 --> 00:15:50,040
Gyeol has no father, Su Nam.

173
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:55,789
I just don't want to make any more
mistakes with you and Heung Sik...

174
00:15:55,814 --> 00:15:59,183
Make them. Make them till you die.

175
00:15:59,208 --> 00:16:03,405
- Su Nam.
- Enough. Just take it all back.

176
00:16:03,581 --> 00:16:06,711
Before I have you locked up
for marriage fraud,

177
00:16:07,528 --> 00:16:09,794
flip it back the way it was.

178
00:16:10,094 --> 00:16:12,694
You flipped it once. Flip it again.

179
00:16:12,828 --> 00:16:14,261
Flip it. Flip it back!

180
00:16:14,761 --> 00:16:17,128
I said flip it back!

181
00:16:17,153 --> 00:16:19,020
I'm sorry, Su Nam.

182
00:16:19,461 --> 00:16:23,584
I'm truly sorry.

183
00:16:23,780 --> 00:16:26,047
Sorry doesn't fix anything!

184
00:16:39,828 --> 00:16:41,328
One more!

185
00:17:02,602 --> 00:17:05,028
What's up?

186
00:17:06,614 --> 00:17:07,909
What?

187
00:17:10,027 --> 00:17:11,548
Are you going easy on me?

188
00:17:12,195 --> 00:17:14,228
Going easy?

189
00:17:15,101 --> 00:17:17,067
I'm not going easy on you.

190
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:20,280
You return every hard shot,
then miss the easy ones on purpose.

191
00:17:20,600 --> 00:17:24,043
It's obvious. "I'm letting you win."

192
00:17:24,153 --> 00:17:27,687
I use everything on the hard ones,
so there's nothing left for the easy ones.

193
00:17:27,921 --> 00:17:30,455
If I played that consistently,
why would I still be here?

194
00:17:30,492 --> 00:17:32,052
I'd be at Wimbledon by now.

195
00:17:32,117 --> 00:17:33,751
Somebody put you up to this.

196
00:17:34,294 --> 00:17:37,537
- Did someone pay you to lose?
- Pay me? Come on!

197
00:17:37,961 --> 00:17:39,974
Back in Wando, I'm a rich man's son.

198
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:45,959
Hey. Did Chairman Jang ask you?

199
00:17:49,407 --> 00:17:52,661
The FBI? I should call them
and tell them to hire you.

200
00:17:54,211 --> 00:17:56,661
Why would he ask you of all people?

201
00:17:56,728 --> 00:17:58,428
Why do you think?

202
00:17:58,428 --> 00:18:01,861
You're the one his wife
takes all her anger out on these days.

203
00:18:02,274 --> 00:18:05,145
If I were him, I'd feel awful too.

204
00:18:09,707 --> 00:18:11,859
What? Done playing?

205
00:18:12,161 --> 00:18:14,572
Why keep going when I'll just win?

206
00:18:17,239 --> 00:18:19,039
It's rough, isn't it?

207
00:18:20,161 --> 00:18:23,528
First it's you making Seo Hyeon cry.

208
00:18:23,587 --> 00:18:26,595
Then you start dating her like they said,
and they scold you for that too.

209
00:18:26,620 --> 00:18:28,666
What are you supposed to do?

210
00:18:28,881 --> 00:18:30,448
It's like they're toying with you...

211
00:18:30,473 --> 00:18:33,112
They could at least agree on one thing.

212
00:18:33,361 --> 00:18:34,873
By the way...

213
00:18:36,928 --> 00:18:39,625
If Seo Hyeon ran away,
would you take her in?

214
00:18:40,820 --> 00:18:44,804
- What are you talking about?
- She already did. To our place.

215
00:18:44,994 --> 00:18:47,412
Into your arms, to be exact.

216
00:18:59,827 --> 00:19:01,093
Mu Jin.

217
00:19:03,727 --> 00:19:05,327
What are you doing here?

218
00:19:05,940 --> 00:19:07,588
I was hungry, so I had some cereal.

219
00:19:08,575 --> 00:19:10,724
Jeong Woo gave me the door code.

220
00:19:10,854 --> 00:19:12,807
Did you tell your parents you left?

221
00:19:13,767 --> 00:19:16,996
No. I snuck out while Mom
was at the hair salon.

222
00:19:17,427 --> 00:19:19,956
I texted her, so she knows by now.

223
00:19:21,947 --> 00:19:24,150
- Let's go.
- Go where?

224
00:19:24,567 --> 00:19:25,825
Your house.

225
00:19:28,175 --> 00:19:30,168
Do I look like I'm joking?

226
00:19:30,781 --> 00:19:34,949
I thought about it a thousand times,
and I left because it was killing me.

227
00:19:35,228 --> 00:19:37,761
Your mother said she'd cut you off
if you saw me.

228
00:19:38,294 --> 00:19:40,927
If Mom keeps this up,
then I'll cut her off too.

229
00:19:41,194 --> 00:19:43,794
Same for Dad if he keeps objecting.

230
00:19:43,794 --> 00:19:45,961
I'll just cut ties with my parents.

231
00:19:47,748 --> 00:19:49,884
Give me a break. Come on.

232
00:19:50,068 --> 00:19:54,064
Mu Jin!

233
00:19:55,141 --> 00:19:56,729
I'm not going home.

234
00:19:57,435 --> 00:20:00,843
If me staying at your place is too much,
drop me at a hotel.

235
00:20:03,253 --> 00:20:05,221
I said I'm not going home.

236
00:20:05,461 --> 00:20:10,250
Me cutting off my family
and walking out is enough.

237
00:20:13,894 --> 00:20:15,959
This way solves nothing.

238
00:20:16,894 --> 00:20:18,794
Why do you think I'm doing this?

239
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:22,688
What if Mom never gives in?
What if she says no to the end?

240
00:20:23,113 --> 00:20:24,874
Will you break up with me then?

241
00:20:25,140 --> 00:20:26,981
I'll try everything I can.

242
00:20:27,006 --> 00:20:30,136
And if you've tried everything
and she still says no?

243
00:20:30,161 --> 00:20:32,207
Try everything there is to try,

244
00:20:32,761 --> 00:20:36,826
leave nothing untried,
and then we'll talk.

245
00:20:45,694 --> 00:20:50,049
Why bother leaving if you were just
going to get dragged back like this?

246
00:20:50,728 --> 00:20:52,994
It's not like I wanted to come back.

247
00:20:53,647 --> 00:20:54,947
What?

248
00:20:55,894 --> 00:20:57,261
I'm sorry.

249
00:20:58,894 --> 00:21:01,494
If you keep me from seeing Mu Jin,

250
00:21:01,661 --> 00:21:03,394
next time I'll leave for real.

251
00:21:03,419 --> 00:21:05,152
Just disown me and be done with it.

252
00:21:07,061 --> 00:21:09,561
What happened to you?

253
00:21:10,294 --> 00:21:12,695
Is this what you've turned her into?

254
00:21:13,628 --> 00:21:16,628
Am I a child? Stop being unreasonable.

255
00:21:17,600 --> 00:21:19,034
Please don't worry too much.

256
00:21:19,141 --> 00:21:21,841
If Seo Hyeon leaves again,
I'll bring her right back.

257
00:21:22,420 --> 00:21:23,520
Mu Jin!

258
00:21:24,894 --> 00:21:28,502
When you do this, I lose more ground.

259
00:21:28,961 --> 00:21:31,088
I lose more of my chances.

260
00:21:32,201 --> 00:21:34,212
I do it because I feel awful for you.

261
00:21:34,398 --> 00:21:36,535
My mom shouldn't treat you this way...

262
00:21:36,560 --> 00:21:38,428
It's driving me crazy.

263
00:21:38,453 --> 00:21:41,002
I'm fine with all of it.

264
00:21:41,993 --> 00:21:44,471
Say what you like to me. I'm fine.

265
00:21:44,614 --> 00:21:46,647
I understand how you feel, ma'am.

266
00:21:46,672 --> 00:21:48,539
Understand? Understand what?

267
00:21:48,694 --> 00:21:50,728
You're the strange one here.

268
00:21:50,728 --> 00:21:52,194
All my friends say you're strange.

269
00:21:52,228 --> 00:21:54,528
Everyone I know says
they can't understand it.

270
00:21:54,528 --> 00:21:56,096
Jang Seo Hyeon!

271
00:21:56,167 --> 00:21:58,813
I know I'm a disappointment,
but I'll do better.

272
00:21:59,394 --> 00:22:02,683
You may not approve of me,
but I'll work even harder.

273
00:22:04,574 --> 00:22:05,836
Say something.

274
00:22:05,861 --> 00:22:08,299
Why should someone as good as him
be treated like this?

275
00:22:08,347 --> 00:22:10,365
You're way out of line, Mom.

276
00:22:14,614 --> 00:22:15,947
Mom!

277
00:22:21,528 --> 00:22:25,128
(Suragan Side Dishes)

278
00:22:34,594 --> 00:22:35,961
(Now Hiring)

279
00:22:35,961 --> 00:22:37,228
(Honest People Preferred)

280
00:22:38,948 --> 00:22:42,814
So you go look somewhere else.

281
00:22:43,940 --> 00:22:46,121
What? Didn't catch that?

282
00:22:46,728 --> 00:22:50,296
You're fired. Your paycheck is gone.

283
00:22:50,968 --> 00:22:55,903
And that house your family lives in,

284
00:22:56,327 --> 00:22:59,580
get out of it within three months.

285
00:23:00,260 --> 00:23:01,394
Sorry?

286
00:23:01,419 --> 00:23:04,585
I'd throw you out this second if I could,

287
00:23:05,006 --> 00:23:10,392
but there's some tenant-and-landlord
rule or whatever.

288
00:23:10,620 --> 00:23:14,037
I have to give three months' notice.

289
00:23:15,853 --> 00:23:21,204
Our landlord said that house
was empty because it's haunted...

290
00:23:21,229 --> 00:23:26,123
That's me. I'm that landlord.

291
00:23:26,474 --> 00:23:28,574
Your situation was so pitiful...

292
00:23:28,661 --> 00:23:31,752
that I lied about it being haunted...

293
00:23:31,981 --> 00:23:36,081
and gave you the deposit and rent
for practically nothing. That was me.

294
00:23:36,394 --> 00:23:40,891
Never dreaming I'd get stabbed
in the back like this.

295
00:23:41,347 --> 00:23:45,881
Now that you know I own several houses
and I'm loaded, what do you say?

296
00:23:46,828 --> 00:23:50,010
Want to think it over again?

297
00:23:50,355 --> 00:23:52,855
If you show some regret now...

298
00:23:53,374 --> 00:23:57,007
I might give you one more chance.

299
00:24:01,761 --> 00:24:04,185
I'm sorry, Su Nam.

300
00:24:07,294 --> 00:24:09,910
Look at you kicking away your own luck.

301
00:24:11,155 --> 00:24:14,688
Fine, then. The house is out,
and the job is out.

302
00:24:14,794 --> 00:24:17,928
Let's each go our own way.

303
00:24:40,694 --> 00:24:42,461
(Naeil Bank)

304
00:24:42,461 --> 00:24:43,994
(Naeil Main Account)

305
00:24:54,919 --> 00:24:58,394
Gyu Yeong, I'm really sorry, but...

306
00:24:58,461 --> 00:25:02,761
We have to move out,
so I need money for a deposit...

307
00:25:05,502 --> 00:25:08,676
The first is about 20,000 dollars,
and the second is 5,000 more.

308
00:25:08,961 --> 00:25:10,941
Which one should I get, sweetie?

309
00:25:15,673 --> 00:25:17,464
Sorry, wrong chat.

310
00:25:26,114 --> 00:25:29,253
- What?
- It's obviously not two dollars.

311
00:25:29,547 --> 00:25:32,493
Why are you buying your fiance
a 20,000-dollar watch?

312
00:25:32,874 --> 00:25:35,703
What's it to you? I said it was a mistake.

313
00:25:35,728 --> 00:25:37,094
With our finances...

314
00:25:39,421 --> 00:25:41,837
How can you afford this?

315
00:25:42,527 --> 00:25:45,871
My stepdad gave me a huge wedding gift.
I'm using that money. Why?

316
00:25:47,314 --> 00:25:49,938
Shocking? The gap is something, isn't it?

317
00:25:50,128 --> 00:25:51,828
That's the world Mom lives in.

318
00:25:51,928 --> 00:25:54,161
And the world I'm going to live in.

319
00:25:55,054 --> 00:25:59,670
That's why she never came to us
or acknowledged us all this time.

320
00:25:59,733 --> 00:26:02,433
Afraid we'd become a weakness
and get her thrown out of it.

321
00:26:02,694 --> 00:26:05,028
Afraid we'd cling and drag her down.

322
00:26:05,861 --> 00:26:07,928
Once I'm married, don't acknowledge me.

323
00:26:08,074 --> 00:26:10,193
You know I can't stand bugs, right?

324
00:26:10,461 --> 00:26:11,969
Parasites especially.

325
00:26:17,280 --> 00:26:18,547
So annoying.

326
00:26:23,440 --> 00:26:26,502
The first is about 20,000 dollars,
and the second is 5,000 more.

327
00:26:26,527 --> 00:26:28,172
Which one should I get, sweetie?

328
00:26:34,737 --> 00:26:35,961
Sweetie.

329
00:26:37,033 --> 00:26:39,576
- Are things tight lately?
- What?

330
00:26:42,094 --> 00:26:46,414
Don't tell me you thought this
was my everyday watch.

331
00:26:49,354 --> 00:26:53,441
I thought I was clear enough
about the brand and model I wanted.

332
00:26:55,028 --> 00:26:58,894
I picked a classy wedding watch, so...

333
00:26:58,973 --> 00:27:00,540
Classy?

334
00:27:01,567 --> 00:27:04,953
Since you brought it up...

335
00:27:06,107 --> 00:27:09,074
All my friends say I'm being conned
into this marriage,

336
00:27:09,099 --> 00:27:11,429
and to dig into your past. You know that?

337
00:27:11,928 --> 00:27:15,208
- Conned? Look into my background?
- Yes.

338
00:27:15,527 --> 00:27:19,086
The way you pick gifts shows
your family and your upbringing.

339
00:27:19,741 --> 00:27:21,457
And judging by that...

340
00:27:25,767 --> 00:27:28,500
they say you look like a corner-store kid.

341
00:27:28,524 --> 00:27:31,788
- Are you finished?
- Not even close.

342
00:27:32,224 --> 00:27:34,781
There's plenty more I want to say,
but I'm holding it in.

343
00:27:36,291 --> 00:27:37,586
For the sake of your pride.

344
00:27:39,424 --> 00:27:41,991
So what do you want? Call off the wedding?

345
00:27:42,757 --> 00:27:43,791
Do you want to?

346
00:27:46,091 --> 00:27:47,791
Call it off if that's what you want.

347
00:27:50,091 --> 00:27:52,091
Why are you doing this to me?
Did something happen?

348
00:27:52,491 --> 00:27:54,542
Why are you suddenly like this?

349
00:28:06,891 --> 00:28:08,124
That jerk Chang Ho...

350
00:28:10,730 --> 00:28:12,863
His mother-in-law bought him a new car.

351
00:28:13,224 --> 00:28:16,857
And Dong Yeong's father-in-law
got him a golf club membership.

352
00:28:23,924 --> 00:28:28,091
They ask what your family did for me,
and I've got nothing to say.

353
00:28:30,891 --> 00:28:33,657
What do you mean, nothing to say?
Just say you got spending money.

354
00:28:34,737 --> 00:28:37,120
How much? A thousand dollars?

355
00:28:37,710 --> 00:28:39,147
For gum money?

356
00:28:40,130 --> 00:28:41,164
A hundred thousand.

357
00:28:44,057 --> 00:28:46,745
I'm miserable enough. Don't lie to me.

358
00:28:46,924 --> 00:28:47,991
I'm not lying.

359
00:28:57,357 --> 00:29:01,195
My dad said to give it to you.
I forgot for a second.

360
00:29:11,357 --> 00:29:14,057
(Cashier's Check, 100,000 Dollars)

361
00:29:16,057 --> 00:29:17,824
Your father shouldn't have.

362
00:29:18,757 --> 00:29:21,722
Still look like a corner-store kid?

363
00:29:22,457 --> 00:29:23,891
No.

364
00:29:25,124 --> 00:29:28,924
Department store class.
Seven Star Hotel level.

365
00:29:29,291 --> 00:29:32,333
That was just clueless idiots talking.

366
00:29:32,358 --> 00:29:36,040
I always knew your class.

367
00:29:36,891 --> 00:29:38,169
- Sweetie.
- Yes?

368
00:29:38,757 --> 00:29:40,491
- I...
- Yes.

369
00:29:40,924 --> 00:29:42,257
One cafe latte, please.

370
00:29:43,291 --> 00:29:45,755
Sure. I'll be right back.

371
00:29:47,638 --> 00:29:51,484
Let's get that watch from before.
Keep it modest.

372
00:29:52,391 --> 00:29:53,424
You're still buying it?

373
00:29:53,957 --> 00:29:55,491
You said you would.

374
00:29:57,391 --> 00:29:58,424
Right.

375
00:30:00,457 --> 00:30:03,378
- And no syrup for me.
- Sure.

376
00:30:08,457 --> 00:30:09,724
Did it go well with Kwon Hui Na?

377
00:30:11,224 --> 00:30:12,291
She didn't show?

378
00:30:12,724 --> 00:30:14,091
How long did you wait?

379
00:30:14,624 --> 00:30:15,691
Until dawn.

380
00:30:16,424 --> 00:30:18,524
Min Ju said she passed on the message.

381
00:30:18,950 --> 00:30:21,876
- Was she busy?
- She just didn't want to come.

382
00:30:22,491 --> 00:30:24,357
What woman would ever turn you down?

383
00:30:27,057 --> 00:30:30,591
Right, Min Ju said she's meeting
Hui Na again today.

384
00:30:31,924 --> 00:30:33,424
I know where they're meeting.

385
00:30:33,724 --> 00:30:35,924
Want to run into her by accident?

386
00:30:37,257 --> 00:30:40,157
If she won't come out, you go in.
That's what a man does.

387
00:30:40,891 --> 00:30:42,757
Forget it. I'd scare her.

388
00:30:43,424 --> 00:30:46,557
You'd let go of a girl you've missed
for years, just like that?

389
00:30:46,757 --> 00:30:48,157
The great Han Gyu O?

390
00:30:49,424 --> 00:30:51,657
Come on. Let's go.

391
00:30:51,791 --> 00:30:53,524
Let's go get Kwon Hui Na.

392
00:30:55,491 --> 00:30:56,557
Sit down.

393
00:30:58,624 --> 00:30:59,624
Sit down?

394
00:31:00,791 --> 00:31:03,057
We're not really that close, are we?

395
00:31:06,191 --> 00:31:07,257
So what?

396
00:31:07,991 --> 00:31:09,857
Then why help me this much?

397
00:31:10,091 --> 00:31:11,791
You helped me once too.

398
00:31:12,424 --> 00:31:13,424
I did?

399
00:31:13,424 --> 00:31:18,801
Local thugs were beating me up
for money, and you saved me.

400
00:31:22,891 --> 00:31:23,924
I don't remember that.

401
00:31:25,111 --> 00:31:28,338
Right, there were plenty of kids
you helped back then.

402
00:31:29,430 --> 00:31:31,242
You were really cool back then.

403
00:31:31,724 --> 00:31:33,609
A total hero.

404
00:31:33,857 --> 00:31:36,569
Enough. This is embarrassing. Stop.

405
00:31:39,731 --> 00:31:42,465
You're really not going to try again?

406
00:31:42,490 --> 00:31:43,745
You're done eating, right?

407
00:31:45,757 --> 00:31:47,357
By the way, what do you do for work?

408
00:31:47,591 --> 00:31:50,411
I asked Yun Gi and he said
he didn't really know.

409
00:32:04,324 --> 00:32:06,432
- It's obvious.
- Isn't it?

410
00:32:06,457 --> 00:32:08,057
- A gigolo.
- A gigolo.

411
00:32:11,124 --> 00:32:14,157
You sound like a kid,
and I don't take kids.

412
00:32:14,357 --> 00:32:15,724
Call me when you're older.

413
00:32:15,724 --> 00:32:17,157
Why, you little...

414
00:32:18,157 --> 00:32:20,224
Does your mom know you live like this?

415
00:32:20,924 --> 00:32:25,545
Does she know you seduce women
her age and live like a worm?

416
00:32:29,724 --> 00:32:31,794
Did the spicy rice cakes wrong you?

417
00:32:34,543 --> 00:32:36,277
They're just too spicy.

418
00:32:37,124 --> 00:32:39,191
You ordered them extra spicy, level three.

419
00:32:39,257 --> 00:32:42,147
Right, I ordered level three.
Why isn't it spicy at all?

420
00:32:44,097 --> 00:32:45,832
Who did this to you?

421
00:32:46,691 --> 00:32:49,027
What did you do when you met Han Gyu O?

422
00:32:52,124 --> 00:32:53,257
I didn't meet him.

423
00:32:54,391 --> 00:32:55,424
You didn't?

424
00:32:57,503 --> 00:33:00,163
It's not like I had to.

425
00:33:01,057 --> 00:33:03,687
True, you didn't have to, but...

426
00:33:04,957 --> 00:33:07,991
You're not interested at all?
You'll never meet him?

427
00:33:09,124 --> 00:33:10,157
No.

428
00:33:48,424 --> 00:33:52,011
That gigolo's number from back then...

429
00:33:52,837 --> 00:33:54,711
Do you still have it?

430
00:33:55,324 --> 00:33:58,871
No, I deleted it the second
Mom was done. Bad luck.

431
00:34:00,451 --> 00:34:01,946
Why do you want that gigolo's number?

432
00:34:02,991 --> 00:34:03,991
Well?

433
00:34:07,091 --> 00:34:10,724
What if that number was wrong?

434
00:34:11,524 --> 00:34:12,524
What?

435
00:34:12,591 --> 00:34:17,557
One of the eight digits after the prefix
could have been off.

436
00:34:18,024 --> 00:34:20,485
We'd been drinking that night...

437
00:34:21,357 --> 00:34:25,906
I might have hit one digit wrong.

438
00:34:26,624 --> 00:34:29,560
Then he'd have said,
"I think you have the wrong number."

439
00:34:29,657 --> 00:34:32,894
You were calling each other names
and really going at it.

440
00:34:34,730 --> 00:34:37,829
Is level three the hottest here?
Nothing spicier?

441
00:34:39,291 --> 00:34:41,550
You're being so weird today.

442
00:34:41,924 --> 00:34:45,304
No thread to anything you say.
No beginning, middle, or end.

443
00:34:47,764 --> 00:34:49,221
But Kwon Hui Na.

444
00:34:50,391 --> 00:34:53,024
You'll really never see Han Gyu O again?

445
00:34:53,557 --> 00:34:55,191
Truly the end?

446
00:34:55,624 --> 00:34:58,058
Don't bring up Han Gyu O around me again.

447
00:34:58,724 --> 00:35:01,308
Excuse me, more hot sauce here, please.

448
00:35:01,657 --> 00:35:04,174
Then let me say one last thing
about Han Gyu O.

449
00:35:05,024 --> 00:35:06,762
Give me Han Gyu O.

450
00:35:08,991 --> 00:35:12,043
You said you won't see him,
so I'll be the one who does.

451
00:35:12,257 --> 00:35:13,257
Hey...

452
00:35:14,924 --> 00:35:17,254
Hey, you have a boyfriend.

453
00:35:17,391 --> 00:35:20,127
Your boyfriend is his friend, no less.

454
00:35:21,499 --> 00:35:24,099
When Han Gyu O and Su Chan sit together,

455
00:35:24,124 --> 00:35:27,007
Han Gyu O radiates this whole aura,
and at the same time...

456
00:35:27,191 --> 00:35:29,582
Su Chan just fades into the wall.

457
00:35:29,997 --> 00:35:31,579
What do you make of that?

458
00:35:32,610 --> 00:35:34,851
Still, that's not right.

459
00:35:35,257 --> 00:35:37,624
Judge me all you want. I don't care.

460
00:35:37,957 --> 00:35:39,491
I'm ending things with Su Chan soon.

461
00:35:39,891 --> 00:35:43,458
No. Anyone else, but never you.

462
00:35:44,014 --> 00:35:46,724
Why not? You said you didn't want him.

463
00:35:48,657 --> 00:35:49,857
Either way, absolutely not.

464
00:35:49,991 --> 00:35:54,299
Dump your boyfriend, I don't care.
Love your friend's friend, I don't care.

465
00:35:54,924 --> 00:35:57,974
Every man in the world is fair game,
but never Han Gyu O.

466
00:36:01,091 --> 00:36:03,957
But why am I asking your permission?

467
00:36:04,691 --> 00:36:07,291
You're not his mother or his girlfriend.

468
00:36:07,477 --> 00:36:09,577
It's not like you own him.

469
00:36:09,724 --> 00:36:11,391
Min Ju.

470
00:36:11,857 --> 00:36:14,391
I won't be calling you anymore,

471
00:36:14,591 --> 00:36:16,024
but I'll answer if you call.

472
00:36:17,657 --> 00:36:18,757
Call me.

473
00:36:50,191 --> 00:36:51,224
Hello.

474
00:36:51,891 --> 00:36:53,691
I heard you're taking time off work.

475
00:36:55,391 --> 00:36:56,391
Yes.

476
00:36:56,591 --> 00:36:58,224
Landed yourself a big spender?

477
00:36:59,991 --> 00:37:01,203
It's nothing like that.

478
00:37:01,857 --> 00:37:04,057
Something urgent came up,
so I'll call you back later...

479
00:37:04,057 --> 00:37:06,924
When will you ever pay off your debt
if you keep turning down work?

480
00:37:07,791 --> 00:37:10,295
Don't you know the interest
piles on top of interest?

481
00:37:10,857 --> 00:37:12,936
How long do you think you'll be hot?

482
00:37:13,357 --> 00:37:18,188
You'll hit 30 fast, and kids in their 20s
will push you out overnight.

483
00:37:18,524 --> 00:37:20,091
Earn while you still can.

484
00:37:20,124 --> 00:37:22,583
I'm sorry. I'm hanging up now.

485
00:37:22,690 --> 00:37:24,022
Listen here, you punk.

486
00:37:24,691 --> 00:37:26,933
Why butt into other people's business?

487
00:37:27,157 --> 00:37:29,791
You think you can pay that off
if you work until the day you die?

488
00:37:41,330 --> 00:37:42,462
You little...

489
00:37:55,091 --> 00:37:57,024
Hey. Wreck him.

490
00:37:57,746 --> 00:37:58,889
Hey!

491
00:38:10,624 --> 00:38:12,724
Hey!

492
00:38:33,057 --> 00:38:35,224
Hey, punk. Where are you running to?

493
00:39:11,657 --> 00:39:14,657
I'll take care of you for life.

494
00:39:15,757 --> 00:39:17,457
Until I've put you back the way you were.

495
00:39:36,291 --> 00:39:40,657
Ma'am, you still have an outstanding loan,

496
00:39:40,824 --> 00:39:43,370
and we see some late payments too.

497
00:39:45,057 --> 00:39:47,763
Then how much more can I get?

498
00:39:59,557 --> 00:40:00,891
Gyu Rim and me.

499
00:40:02,491 --> 00:40:06,691
We're going back to being just friends,
like we used to be.

500
00:40:10,324 --> 00:40:11,457
So?

501
00:40:12,091 --> 00:40:14,146
You don't seem too happy.

502
00:40:14,991 --> 00:40:16,324
Should I be?

503
00:40:18,763 --> 00:40:21,736
So it really is over with Gyu Rim.

504
00:40:22,391 --> 00:40:26,672
Look, being here face-to-face with you...

505
00:40:27,157 --> 00:40:28,957
is really uncomfortable for me.

506
00:40:31,357 --> 00:40:35,221
Say what you came to say and get out,
is what you mean.

507
00:40:36,298 --> 00:40:39,157
Fine. I'll say it and get out, then.

508
00:40:42,391 --> 00:40:47,757
Gyu Rim said she didn't want to lie
to herself or to me anymore,

509
00:40:48,424 --> 00:40:50,757
and to take back the proposal.

510
00:40:51,291 --> 00:40:56,037
So I said, "Sure, let's do that.
You make me plenty uncomfortable too."

511
00:40:56,657 --> 00:41:00,681
"Let's do that savings club once a month."
Then I went home,

512
00:41:04,657 --> 00:41:08,157
I fried an egg, mixed it into rice,

513
00:41:10,024 --> 00:41:11,957
and really thought I was fine.

514
00:41:13,924 --> 00:41:20,624
But as time went on, it was like
a hole had opened in my chest...

515
00:41:22,224 --> 00:41:25,478
I couldn't settle down
or do anything about it.

516
00:41:26,744 --> 00:41:28,944
Like the world had caved in...

517
00:41:29,957 --> 00:41:33,991
I couldn't sit still,
and I couldn't stand still,

518
00:41:35,324 --> 00:41:37,524
I was going to see a psychiatrist,

519
00:41:37,791 --> 00:41:41,824
but my feet brought me to you, Chef,
without me even knowing.

520
00:41:48,157 --> 00:41:49,657
Am I that easy to push around?

521
00:41:51,063 --> 00:41:54,249
You got dumped by Gyu Rim
before I did, didn't you?

522
00:41:54,724 --> 00:41:57,857
I never even held her hand,
and getting dumped feels like this.

523
00:41:58,057 --> 00:42:00,339
You had a love that deep,

524
00:42:00,457 --> 00:42:04,203
so could you give me some advice
on how you survived losing her?

525
00:42:05,691 --> 00:42:09,057
Some trick for getting over it,

526
00:42:09,124 --> 00:42:13,257
or even if you can't get over it,
something that hurts less...

527
00:42:13,511 --> 00:42:17,111
something that makes it pass faster.
Any tip at all...

528
00:42:18,024 --> 00:42:19,157
I'll get you a taxi.

529
00:42:21,157 --> 00:42:22,624
I know how to hail a taxi myself.

530
00:42:23,757 --> 00:42:25,324
Just teach me.

531
00:42:25,557 --> 00:42:27,724
How you get to be that fine,

532
00:42:28,524 --> 00:42:31,224
and when it stops mattering like that.

533
00:42:32,791 --> 00:42:34,791
Jeong Woo. Park Jeong Woo.

534
00:42:35,050 --> 00:42:36,653
Yes, what?

535
00:42:40,330 --> 00:42:43,257
Show this man the way out
and call him a taxi.

536
00:42:43,624 --> 00:42:46,000
I said I can get my own taxi.

537
00:42:46,891 --> 00:42:49,924
It looks like he needs an ambulance,
not a taxi.

538
00:42:55,657 --> 00:43:00,357
I may not be all right, but I'm not crazy.

539
00:43:01,357 --> 00:43:03,624
I was just that desperate...

540
00:43:06,824 --> 00:43:10,191
No. I am crazy.

541
00:43:11,291 --> 00:43:15,840
If I ever come back here,
slam the door in my face.

542
00:43:24,857 --> 00:43:28,457
(Danimgil Noodles)

543
00:43:36,157 --> 00:43:38,057
What are you staring at so hard?

544
00:43:38,924 --> 00:43:40,091
Ma'am.

545
00:43:42,824 --> 00:43:43,991
What's this?

546
00:43:45,717 --> 00:43:47,642
A flyer for a new tuna place.

547
00:43:49,977 --> 00:43:51,376
Do you want tuna?

548
00:43:51,457 --> 00:43:54,767
My dying wish is to eat tuna
until I burst, just once.

549
00:43:55,857 --> 00:44:00,400
If you love it that much, stop moping
and go eat some tuna.

550
00:44:00,524 --> 00:44:03,791
All you can eat for 30 dollars
isn't a bad price.

551
00:44:03,857 --> 00:44:05,692
And ten percent off for the opening.

552
00:44:06,967 --> 00:44:08,391
Not all you can eat.

553
00:44:08,591 --> 00:44:11,191
The kind over 100 dollars a head.
Tuna omakase.

554
00:44:11,357 --> 00:44:15,591
With tuna, I'm crazy about the eyes,
the gill meat, the belly...

555
00:44:17,098 --> 00:44:18,266
You lunatic.

556
00:44:18,291 --> 00:44:21,728
Is this really the time
to be going on about tuna?

557
00:44:24,424 --> 00:44:25,878
That's how immature I am.

558
00:44:27,291 --> 00:44:28,657
I should have stopped burdening my kids...

559
00:44:28,657 --> 00:44:31,724
and drowned myself in a dish long ago.

560
00:44:33,424 --> 00:44:35,957
Should I just head to the Han River?

561
00:44:36,457 --> 00:44:38,024
What did the Han River ever do?

562
00:44:39,957 --> 00:44:42,557
Right. The river is innocent.

563
00:44:43,291 --> 00:44:44,757
I'm the guilty one here.

564
00:44:45,324 --> 00:44:48,657
Sitting here asking for tuna
at a time like this...

565
00:44:49,091 --> 00:44:52,691
And now that tuna's come up again,
my mouth is watering.

566
00:44:53,891 --> 00:44:56,124
Are you even human?

567
00:44:58,291 --> 00:45:00,857
Do you want tuna that badly?

568
00:45:00,924 --> 00:45:03,035
Yes! No...

569
00:45:04,424 --> 00:45:08,257
Forget it. Don't think about it.

570
00:45:09,091 --> 00:45:10,224
Tuna...

571
00:45:11,591 --> 00:45:13,657
My treat. Let's go eat tuna.

572
00:45:14,391 --> 00:45:18,824
Let me say again,
what I want is tuna omakase.

573
00:45:18,957 --> 00:45:19,991
Follow me.

574
00:45:20,957 --> 00:45:23,557
Did she hear mackerel instead of tuna?

575
00:45:24,624 --> 00:45:27,391
Not mackerel. Tuna.

576
00:45:28,424 --> 00:45:31,091
She heard mackerel again.

577
00:45:38,024 --> 00:45:39,024
Eat up.

578
00:45:39,524 --> 00:45:41,791
I'm not dreaming, am I?

579
00:45:42,891 --> 00:45:45,191
It's not a dream. Go ahead and eat.

580
00:45:46,924 --> 00:45:48,191
How much per person?

581
00:45:48,357 --> 00:45:49,591
Three hundred dollars.

582
00:45:50,091 --> 00:45:51,124
Three hundred?

583
00:45:52,691 --> 00:45:53,791
Enjoy your meal.

584
00:45:55,324 --> 00:46:00,173
They serve the tuna eye separately
in liquor, so go ahead.

585
00:46:01,824 --> 00:46:03,224
Did you win the lottery?

586
00:46:04,791 --> 00:46:08,848
Not the lottery.
My savings club paid out today.

587
00:46:09,124 --> 00:46:10,735
So please, enjoy your meal.

588
00:46:13,591 --> 00:46:15,191
Why are you being so good to me?

589
00:46:18,324 --> 00:46:22,243
You helped me out that time
with the knockoff shoes,

590
00:46:23,057 --> 00:46:26,157
and I feel a little sorry for you.

591
00:46:28,191 --> 00:46:30,157
Are you pitying me?

592
00:46:30,791 --> 00:46:32,591
It's not pity.

593
00:46:34,591 --> 00:46:37,742
Pity is fine. Pity is still affection.

594
00:46:37,991 --> 00:46:41,495
In a world this cold,
we should at least share some warmth.

595
00:46:42,724 --> 00:46:48,357
And stop calling me mister.
I'm younger, so just call me Seok Jung.

596
00:46:48,891 --> 00:46:50,557
Drop the formalities too, ma'am.

597
00:46:51,691 --> 00:46:55,012
- I'll take my time. Enjoy.
- Yes.

598
00:47:00,257 --> 00:47:01,891
Yes, what is it?

599
00:47:02,897 --> 00:47:03,930
What?

600
00:47:04,724 --> 00:47:07,566
Keep eating. I'll take this call.

601
00:47:07,591 --> 00:47:09,491
- Yes, ma'am.
- Okay.

602
00:47:18,866 --> 00:47:20,024
This is so good.

603
00:47:22,224 --> 00:47:25,338
Good work, everyone.

604
00:47:25,724 --> 00:47:28,062
- Gyu Seo.
- Yes?

605
00:47:28,086 --> 00:47:29,666
How are you not even nervous?

606
00:47:29,691 --> 00:47:31,146
I heard this was your first runway.

607
00:47:31,526 --> 00:47:32,942
I was nervous too, actually.

608
00:47:32,967 --> 00:47:35,665
- You brat.
- Why are you still here?

609
00:47:35,691 --> 00:47:39,382
The after-party's at the club downstairs.
Didn't you get the text?

610
00:47:39,512 --> 00:47:40,657
What about you?

611
00:47:41,819 --> 00:47:43,857
- I'll pass.
- Why not? Why wouldn't you go?

612
00:47:43,882 --> 00:47:47,144
- Come with us.
- He's a minor, idiot.

613
00:47:47,519 --> 00:47:50,486
- Really?
- You'll get us in trouble.

614
00:47:53,906 --> 00:47:55,826
You're so handsome.

615
00:47:55,851 --> 00:47:57,845
Why are you so good-looking, honey?

616
00:47:58,693 --> 00:48:00,589
You said you were quitting!

617
00:48:03,933 --> 00:48:06,510
Didn't you say you'd quit
before Gyu Rim found out?

618
00:48:08,099 --> 00:48:10,398
Sorry, could you go on ahead?

619
00:48:10,659 --> 00:48:13,472
Why? Who is that kid?

620
00:48:13,967 --> 00:48:16,487
- Do you know him, honey?
- Don't call him honey.

621
00:48:16,693 --> 00:48:18,960
My brother is nobody's honey, lady.

622
00:48:20,347 --> 00:48:21,347
Hey.

623
00:48:22,386 --> 00:48:24,647
I'll catch up. Go on ahead.

624
00:48:32,033 --> 00:48:33,828
What on earth are you doing?

625
00:48:34,680 --> 00:48:36,723
Should I tell Gyu Rim everything?

626
00:48:37,770 --> 00:48:38,770
Go.

627
00:48:39,747 --> 00:48:41,360
Let's say you didn't see this today.

628
00:48:45,459 --> 00:48:47,646
Trash like you doesn't even get recycled.

629
00:48:48,048 --> 00:48:49,048
You know that?

630
00:48:52,740 --> 00:48:53,740
I'm not going.

631
00:48:58,106 --> 00:49:00,726
- You're about to get hit.
- Look who's talking.

632
00:49:01,467 --> 00:49:02,559
Just try walking away.

633
00:49:02,819 --> 00:49:04,639
I'll break your legs.

634
00:49:04,674 --> 00:49:05,840
I'm counting to three.

635
00:49:05,865 --> 00:49:08,536
- One.
- Two, three.

636
00:49:09,735 --> 00:49:12,089
Hit me. Go on.

637
00:49:12,901 --> 00:49:14,089
I said hit me.

638
00:49:15,159 --> 00:49:16,594
Why can't you?

639
00:49:16,619 --> 00:49:19,992
You have to swing first
before I can break your legs.

640
00:49:39,110 --> 00:49:42,128
Let go! I said let go!

641
00:49:42,198 --> 00:49:46,392
(Geumje Police, respectful and caring,
community policing with residents)

642
00:50:05,139 --> 00:50:08,092
I'm telling you, she'll be here soon.

643
00:50:08,740 --> 00:50:10,940
Why won't you believe me?

644
00:50:11,433 --> 00:50:12,588
Dad.

645
00:50:14,075 --> 00:50:15,310
Gyu Rim.

646
00:50:15,791 --> 00:50:20,539
When did the world get so cold?

647
00:50:24,540 --> 00:50:26,496
I'm Han Seok Jung's guardian.

648
00:50:27,307 --> 00:50:28,665
You've heard, right?

649
00:50:28,867 --> 00:50:30,756
Your father dined and dashed,

650
00:50:31,011 --> 00:50:32,613
and the restaurant filed a complaint.

651
00:50:32,663 --> 00:50:35,840
I did not dine and dash.

652
00:50:36,113 --> 00:50:39,256
The lady said she'd buy me tuna,
so I just went along.

653
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:42,817
She'd have come if they'd just waited,

654
00:50:42,819 --> 00:50:45,893
but that owner is a rotten piece of work.

655
00:50:46,032 --> 00:50:48,016
You didn't have money for the meal?

656
00:50:48,480 --> 00:50:51,605
Tell me the restaurant and I'll pay.

657
00:50:51,766 --> 00:50:53,569
You can't pay it.

658
00:50:53,831 --> 00:50:57,300
Paying that would make you faint.

659
00:50:58,073 --> 00:51:00,066
How expensive is it?

660
00:51:02,279 --> 00:51:03,692
Three hundred dollars a head.

661
00:51:05,052 --> 00:51:08,187
Two of us, so 600 dollars.
Service charge is extra.

662
00:51:08,740 --> 00:51:11,126
She really said she'd pay.

663
00:51:11,853 --> 00:51:13,374
Who did you eat with?

664
00:51:13,488 --> 00:51:14,612
Have you called her?

665
00:51:16,198 --> 00:51:17,885
I don't know her number,

666
00:51:19,116 --> 00:51:20,433
or her name,

667
00:51:20,839 --> 00:51:22,020
or her address.

668
00:51:23,007 --> 00:51:24,393
I don't know a thing about her.

669
00:51:25,379 --> 00:51:28,128
Did she really stiff me and run?

670
00:51:33,000 --> 00:51:34,020
Unknown number...

671
00:51:34,113 --> 00:51:36,167
See? I told you she'd come.

672
00:51:37,734 --> 00:51:39,322
Ma'am, where are...

673
00:51:41,630 --> 00:51:44,202
Where? The police station?

674
00:51:45,641 --> 00:51:48,880
Who is this, you punk?
Is this a phone scam?

675
00:51:49,720 --> 00:51:51,490
Police station, my foot.

676
00:51:51,515 --> 00:51:54,244
I'm at the police station right now!

677
00:51:57,647 --> 00:51:59,007
Han Gyu Seo?

678
00:52:00,630 --> 00:52:02,083
Han Gyu Seo is my son.

679
00:52:04,224 --> 00:52:05,227
Han Gyu O?

680
00:52:05,840 --> 00:52:07,308
Han Gyu O is...

681
00:52:08,169 --> 00:52:10,053
also my son.

682
00:52:11,153 --> 00:52:13,400
One moment, officer. Yes.

683
00:52:15,132 --> 00:52:19,498
Gyu O and Gyu Seo got in a fight
and they're at a police station.

684
00:52:20,287 --> 00:52:22,413
Officer, what is going on here?

685
00:52:51,122 --> 00:52:52,418
(Gyu Yeong)

686
00:53:07,027 --> 00:53:08,139
One moment.

687
00:53:11,044 --> 00:53:12,377
What?

688
00:53:12,402 --> 00:53:13,665
(Han Gyu Rim)

689
00:53:13,692 --> 00:53:14,692
Han Gyu Yeong.

690
00:53:16,602 --> 00:53:17,602
Han Gyu Yeong!

691
00:53:19,086 --> 00:53:21,299
I'm swamped. Why are you calling
over and over?

692
00:53:21,439 --> 00:53:23,679
If someone calls that many times,

693
00:53:24,428 --> 00:53:27,279
shouldn't you figure something's wrong
and call them back?

694
00:53:27,497 --> 00:53:30,146
What's wrong? Did the house burn down?

695
00:53:30,527 --> 00:53:32,593
I'll send the address. Get here now.

696
00:53:32,966 --> 00:53:34,828
Come pay for Dad's meal...

697
00:53:35,173 --> 00:53:36,566
What are you talking about?

698
00:53:36,667 --> 00:53:38,360
Why would I pay for his meal?

699
00:53:38,420 --> 00:53:39,580
You've got money, right?

700
00:53:39,687 --> 00:53:41,280
You bought your fiance a watch
worth tens of thousands...

701
00:53:43,746 --> 00:53:46,880
Just come pay for his meal
and take him home.

702
00:53:46,905 --> 00:53:49,238
No, you do it. I'm busy.

703
00:53:49,819 --> 00:53:52,705
I have to go get Gyu O and Gyu Seo.

704
00:53:54,746 --> 00:53:58,078
Then pay, take Dad home,
and go get Gyu O and Gyu Seo too.

705
00:53:58,080 --> 00:54:00,559
- I'm busy, so I have to go...
- Why is it all on me?

706
00:54:01,927 --> 00:54:04,403
Aren't you his daughter too?

707
00:54:04,428 --> 00:54:06,447
Aren't you their older sister?

708
00:54:06,859 --> 00:54:08,357
What are you doing?

709
00:54:08,546 --> 00:54:11,217
Why do I always have to do it all?

710
00:54:11,927 --> 00:54:14,282
Sacrificing yourself for the family...

711
00:54:14,324 --> 00:54:16,985
is what you, the eldest, always did.

712
00:54:17,413 --> 00:54:20,680
That's why Gyu O and the twins
would die for you.

713
00:54:20,856 --> 00:54:24,051
You got a taste for it and kept
playing the good one, didn't you?

714
00:54:24,326 --> 00:54:25,326
What did you say?

715
00:54:25,700 --> 00:54:27,551
Don't act surprised now, Han Gyu Rim.

716
00:54:27,553 --> 00:54:28,893
Not very Cinderella of you.

717
00:54:38,854 --> 00:54:41,384
I'll tip you well, so please
pretend you didn't hear any of that.

718
00:54:41,409 --> 00:54:42,703
Yes, understood.

719
00:54:45,470 --> 00:54:52,244
(Gangnam Police Station)

720
00:54:55,486 --> 00:54:57,329
Ma'am, we're here.

721
00:54:59,399 --> 00:55:00,399
Ma'am?

722
00:55:02,553 --> 00:55:03,947
I'm sorry.

723
00:55:12,200 --> 00:55:14,035
I'm sorry, sir,

724
00:55:14,154 --> 00:55:18,104
- could you drop me at a subway station?
- Sure.

725
00:55:22,947 --> 00:55:24,500
Have you completely lost it?

726
00:55:24,666 --> 00:55:27,563
How do you fight Gyu O so badly
that you end up at a police station?

727
00:55:29,667 --> 00:55:32,872
Gyu Rim? I haven't heard from her.

728
00:55:33,126 --> 00:55:36,802
She told Dad she was coming
to us, but she never showed.

729
00:55:39,232 --> 00:55:40,560
Her phone's off too.

730
00:55:42,053 --> 00:55:43,900
Dad came to the station to get us.

731
00:55:44,326 --> 00:55:46,585
We just got out. Heading home now.

732
00:55:46,919 --> 00:55:48,408
After the tone, charges will apply...

733
00:55:48,433 --> 00:55:50,086
Gyeol isn't picking up either.

734
00:55:50,360 --> 00:55:51,406
I'll call again.

735
00:55:54,039 --> 00:55:55,793
Where did Gyu Rim go?

736
00:55:55,818 --> 00:55:57,578
You'll be connected to voicemail.

737
00:55:58,453 --> 00:56:00,066
Her phone is still off.

738
00:56:03,187 --> 00:56:05,604
Why did you contact her?

739
00:56:05,879 --> 00:56:07,146
Proud of getting in a fight?

740
00:56:07,447 --> 00:56:09,187
I didn't contact Gyu Rim.

741
00:56:09,540 --> 00:56:12,185
I gave the cops Dad's number
so she wouldn't worry.

742
00:56:18,080 --> 00:56:21,284
Why did you tell her, Dad?

743
00:56:21,933 --> 00:56:24,687
Gyu Rim's been to police stations a lot,

744
00:56:24,893 --> 00:56:27,970
so I figured she'd know the ropes.

745
00:56:29,986 --> 00:56:33,885
I sat in front of a cop for three hours
and had a panic attack.

746
00:56:33,910 --> 00:56:36,257
Cold sweat down my back,
and I couldn't breathe.

747
00:56:36,560 --> 00:56:38,069
You were at a station too, Dad?

748
00:56:38,417 --> 00:56:40,190
Who, me?

749
00:56:41,192 --> 00:56:42,287
Did you run another scam?

750
00:56:42,320 --> 00:56:44,047
I don't run scams.

751
00:56:44,280 --> 00:56:45,913
If anything, I get scammed.

752
00:56:46,180 --> 00:56:49,870
I went in as the victim.

753
00:56:51,165 --> 00:56:52,726
I'm sure you did.

754
00:56:53,287 --> 00:56:55,809
I got conned by some woman.

755
00:56:56,680 --> 00:56:59,039
Please grow up.

756
00:56:59,433 --> 00:57:01,804
How did you let it get this bad?

757
00:57:01,807 --> 00:57:03,473
Can't anything get handled without me?

758
00:57:03,933 --> 00:57:05,946
How many hours was that meeting?

759
00:57:06,654 --> 00:57:09,985
I'm sorry. You worked so hard.

760
00:57:10,199 --> 00:57:11,319
I'm hungry.

761
00:57:15,557 --> 00:57:19,213
Why do I have this nagging feeling?

762
00:57:20,220 --> 00:57:22,966
About what? Today's meeting?

763
00:57:24,172 --> 00:57:26,497
No, not the meeting...

764
00:57:29,006 --> 00:57:34,246
- Tuna!
- Should I order tuna?

765
00:57:37,359 --> 00:57:39,106
She must be starving.

766
00:57:42,753 --> 00:57:44,082
Mu Jin.

767
00:57:52,233 --> 00:57:53,680
Drink.

768
00:57:55,648 --> 00:57:57,550
I'm a little drunk.

769
00:57:57,575 --> 00:58:00,293
I put away a bottle of whiskey
before I got here.

770
00:58:02,707 --> 00:58:04,027
Aren't you drinking too much?

771
00:58:04,029 --> 00:58:05,923
I'll go get some water.

772
00:58:06,427 --> 00:58:07,489
It's fine. Sit.

773
00:58:08,317 --> 00:58:09,317
It's fine.

774
00:58:12,633 --> 00:58:13,633
Hey.

775
00:58:16,245 --> 00:58:19,419
If that day,

776
00:58:19,518 --> 00:58:24,052
I hadn't fed you that spicy squid,

777
00:58:25,306 --> 00:58:26,604
and if...

778
00:58:27,732 --> 00:58:30,606
Seo Hyeon hadn't made such a scene,

779
00:58:34,286 --> 00:58:38,127
would you have accepted her feelings?

780
00:58:38,587 --> 00:58:40,926
Could you have made that choice?

781
00:58:43,686 --> 00:58:44,893
You couldn't have.

782
00:58:45,795 --> 00:58:47,118
Never. Not you.

783
00:58:48,173 --> 00:58:49,267
I know you.

784
00:58:49,706 --> 00:58:51,254
Your whole life, from childhood until now,

785
00:58:51,256 --> 00:58:53,884
you've never once seen Seo Hyeon
as a woman.

786
00:58:54,159 --> 00:58:55,159
I know that.

787
00:58:57,487 --> 00:58:59,053
I'll try harder.

788
00:58:59,391 --> 00:59:02,680
Does love work by trying?

789
00:59:03,100 --> 00:59:04,401
What is this, the Joseon era?

790
00:59:05,634 --> 00:59:06,939
Trying?

791
00:59:09,027 --> 00:59:11,394
I'm the one who stopped her from leaving,

792
00:59:12,524 --> 00:59:15,473
and that choice was mine to make.

793
00:59:19,325 --> 00:59:20,515
But...

794
00:59:22,107 --> 00:59:25,348
Seo Hyeon is so happy these days.

795
00:59:26,973 --> 00:59:27,973
She says...

796
00:59:28,505 --> 00:59:30,542
she feels like she has the whole world.

797
00:59:31,446 --> 00:59:34,230
Like she's on cloud nine every day.

798
00:59:36,359 --> 00:59:38,912
And watching her, I think,

799
00:59:39,760 --> 00:59:41,980
"So this is happiness." And I'm happy.

800
00:59:43,277 --> 00:59:45,348
So lately, behind her mother's back,

801
00:59:45,373 --> 00:59:48,188
I go off in a corner and grin.

802
00:59:51,413 --> 00:59:53,707
Like a shameless lunatic.

803
00:59:55,685 --> 00:59:56,685
Mu Jin.

804
00:59:58,288 --> 01:00:02,446
Sometimes I wonder if Seo Hyeon and I...

805
01:00:03,174 --> 01:00:06,546
are being happy on top of your misery.

806
01:00:07,920 --> 01:00:09,466
And if so, how is that right?

807
01:00:09,919 --> 01:00:11,332
I'm not unhappy.

808
01:00:11,540 --> 01:00:15,466
As I said, this was my own choice.

809
01:00:18,846 --> 01:00:20,120
Right.

810
01:00:22,013 --> 01:00:24,890
Fine. All right.

811
01:00:25,387 --> 01:00:26,763
I don't care anymore.

812
01:00:27,099 --> 01:00:29,602
From now on I'm keeping my mouth shut,

813
01:00:29,769 --> 01:00:32,088
my eyes closed and my ears plugged.

814
01:00:32,336 --> 01:00:34,480
Got it? You handle it all.

815
01:00:34,507 --> 01:00:36,940
You made the decision,
so you take the responsibility.

816
01:00:37,775 --> 01:00:42,278
And whatever her mother pulls,

817
01:00:42,399 --> 01:00:44,506
stubborn or unreasonable, you handle it.

818
01:00:44,873 --> 01:00:45,873
Yes.

819
01:00:46,040 --> 01:00:47,274
And...

820
01:00:51,260 --> 01:00:52,389
Never mind.

821
01:00:54,027 --> 01:00:57,217
I'm done talking.

822
01:01:00,680 --> 01:01:03,519
The more I talk, the less sense I make,

823
01:01:03,521 --> 01:01:06,840
I don't know what I'm saying,
and I'm dying of embarrassment.

824
01:01:09,399 --> 01:01:10,660
Jang Hun Tae,

825
01:01:11,229 --> 01:01:13,139
I never knew I was this pathetic.

826
01:01:14,947 --> 01:01:18,187
Maybe every father with a daughter
is like this.

827
01:01:18,580 --> 01:01:22,100
I'm done. Mu Jin, I'll head out first.
Stay seated.

828
01:01:23,399 --> 01:01:25,714
- Clean up and come along.
- Yes.

829
01:01:28,833 --> 01:01:31,016
- Mu Jin.
- Yes.

830
01:01:37,035 --> 01:01:38,199
A good kid.

831
01:01:40,637 --> 01:01:41,753
A kind kid.

832
01:01:44,546 --> 01:01:46,070
A kid I feel for.

833
01:01:48,579 --> 01:01:51,748
I can't look at you anymore today.
Don't follow me.

834
01:01:51,773 --> 01:01:54,167
- I'm off. Go on.
- Get home safe.

835
01:02:06,832 --> 01:02:09,014
Yes, I'm outside the house.

836
01:02:09,937 --> 01:02:10,937
Yes.

837
01:02:12,138 --> 01:02:14,742
I reached Gyeol. He's home with her.

838
01:02:15,106 --> 01:02:16,326
They're home?

839
01:02:16,987 --> 01:02:19,147
Then why turn off her phone
and make us worry?

840
01:02:22,587 --> 01:02:24,967
- Hold on.
- What?

841
01:02:25,933 --> 01:02:27,513
I'll run out and get some tofu.

842
01:02:27,706 --> 01:02:28,780
Eat it before you go in.

843
01:02:28,907 --> 01:02:32,218
What did we do that deserves tofu?

844
01:02:32,220 --> 01:02:35,413
You two may be used to police stations,
but it was my first time.

845
01:02:35,960 --> 01:02:37,886
This kid watches too much TV.

846
01:02:38,320 --> 01:02:40,927
- You don't have to eat it.
- It bugs me. Let's just eat it.

847
01:02:40,929 --> 01:02:42,707
You think tofu keeps you out for good?

848
01:02:43,604 --> 01:02:44,705
Gyu O is right.

849
01:02:44,796 --> 01:02:46,786
Tofu or not, some people go back.

850
01:02:49,058 --> 01:02:53,052
I heard you all got into
all kinds of trouble...

851
01:02:53,573 --> 01:02:55,933
You really went all out, didn't you?

852
01:02:56,633 --> 01:02:58,090
And you are?

853
01:02:59,076 --> 01:03:00,811
Do you two know her?

854
01:03:01,326 --> 01:03:02,793
I don't know her.

855
01:03:03,760 --> 01:03:06,267
I have zero interest
in any of your private lives.

856
01:03:06,609 --> 01:03:08,330
The phone is turned off...

857
01:03:08,355 --> 01:03:10,444
Why is Han Gyu Rim's phone off?

858
01:03:10,447 --> 01:03:12,106
I need to get my dress to the cleaners.

859
01:03:13,086 --> 01:03:16,676
- Are you coming from our place?
- Yes.

860
01:03:22,768 --> 01:03:24,066
What's going on?

861
01:03:24,217 --> 01:03:26,832
The penny-pincher who wouldn't order in
to save a buck.

862
01:03:28,970 --> 01:03:30,119
This is good.

863
01:03:30,144 --> 01:03:31,670
- So good, right?
- Can you finish it all?

864
01:03:31,703 --> 01:03:32,833
What is this?

865
01:03:35,463 --> 01:03:38,804
Fried meatballs? Looks good.

866
01:03:41,387 --> 01:03:42,853
I didn't order any for you, Dad.

867
01:03:44,409 --> 01:03:45,960
We can just share.

868
01:03:46,987 --> 01:03:48,333
There's none for you three either.

869
01:03:48,527 --> 01:03:50,105
I only ordered for Gyeol and me.

870
01:03:54,267 --> 01:03:56,779
From now on, do your own laundry,

871
01:03:57,094 --> 01:03:58,889
and fix your own meals.

872
01:04:00,024 --> 01:04:02,480
What? Are you screwing over your family?

873
01:04:03,467 --> 01:04:06,633
Eat whatever you want, all of you.

874
01:04:06,760 --> 01:04:09,910
As of today, I resign
as the eldest of this house.

875
01:04:17,938 --> 01:04:19,613
- Want some sweet and sour pork?
- Yes.

876
01:04:19,614 --> 01:04:20,749
"Resign."

877
01:04:22,646 --> 01:04:23,952
Is this a joke?

878
01:04:25,293 --> 01:04:27,353
It's good, isn't it?

879
01:04:27,378 --> 01:04:30,535
A long time ago, I lost so much.

880
01:04:32,226 --> 01:04:33,451
My mother,

881
01:04:34,350 --> 01:04:35,350
my baby,

882
01:04:36,175 --> 01:04:37,302
Kim Mu Jin,

883
01:04:38,754 --> 01:04:41,032
and me, Han Gyu Rim.

884
01:04:42,793 --> 01:04:45,351
I'm sorry I only told you to endure.

885
01:04:46,100 --> 01:04:48,700
I'm sorry I only told you to hold on.

886
01:04:50,106 --> 01:04:51,761
Saying it was only natural,

887
01:04:51,964 --> 01:04:53,848
that the eldest just had to be that way,

888
01:04:55,757 --> 01:04:57,591
I was so cruel to you alone.

889
01:04:58,423 --> 01:05:01,474
I'm so sorry, Gyu Rim.

890
01:05:29,903 --> 01:05:32,319
(Love on the Menu)

891
01:05:32,344 --> 01:05:35,303
Don't like it? Leave.
You're getting fired anyway.

892
01:05:35,328 --> 01:05:38,866
Why is the world so unfair
to Gyu Rim alone?

893
01:05:38,907 --> 01:05:41,091
That girl who dated Mu Jin,

894
01:05:41,449 --> 01:05:43,132
where can I find her?

895
01:05:43,180 --> 01:05:46,324
Hui Na says she isn't interested in you.

896
01:05:46,325 --> 01:05:47,732
Just date me instead.

897
01:05:47,734 --> 01:05:49,053
I can't take it.

898
01:05:49,807 --> 01:05:51,701
Even if I'm cursed for it, I can't.

899
01:05:51,702 --> 01:05:53,582
Pull yourself together, Kim Mu Jin.

900
01:05:54,407 --> 01:05:55,793
Kim Mu Jin!

901
01:05:55,794 --> 01:05:57,054
Someone calling my name.

902
01:05:57,056 --> 01:05:59,794
She definitely called. It was Gyu Rim.

903
01:05:59,913 --> 01:06:01,265
Found you.

904
01:06:02,762 --> 01:06:04,562
Dramaday.me
